<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Upon ending the subscription, you are required to respond to all communications and calls. Simply discontinuing communication while still operating is not acceptable. You must pay all outstanding bills, along with any applicable penalties. All dues for service usage must be settled on a monthly basis before formally terminating the subscription. Only after clearing all dues may you officially exit the operation. Failure to settle any outstanding dues entitles the Provider to pursue legal action for recovery. The Prime Business Partner agrees to cover all legal costs, administrative fees, and any related expenses incurred during the complaint or dispute resolution process. We encourage open communication to resolve any issues before escalating to legal action.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
